			x: 3.0d,
			y: -6.0d,
			title: "Hire a vanilla worker",
			description: ["Picking a job isn't hiring. A vanilla worker whose job we've extended (an Armorer, a Toolsmith...) is hired with that job's item: hired, they work with your own workers; unhired, they work for their village."],
